+  /**
+   * Every lookup that misses the cache loads through here, so concurrent requests for one user share one object.
+   * A load that finishes after another load for the same user was cached returns the cached object. A load that
+   * started before an invalidation is returned uncached, since it may predate the change that caused it.
+   *
+   * @param {() => Promise<User|null>} loader
+   * @returns {Promise<User|null>}
